<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MapleSure SponsorConnect</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #fff;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #333;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        input[type="text"], input[type="date"], select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        button {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            color: #fff;
            background-color: #007BFF;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }
        #confirmation {
            display: none;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #e9f7ef;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            color: #155724;
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
        }
        .file-list {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }
        .help-section {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            border: 1px solid #add8e6;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container" role="main">
        <h1>Disability Claim Submission</h1>
        <form id="claim-form">
            <label for="policy-number">Policy Number</label>
            <input type="text" id="policy-number" name="policy-number" aria-required="true">

            <label for="member-id">Member ID</label>
            <input type="text" id="member-id" name="member-id" aria-required="true">
            <button type="button" id="lookup-member">Look up member</button>

            <div id="member-details">
                <!-- Fills programmatically -->
            </div>

            <h2>Claim Details</h2>
            <label for="last-day-worked">Last Day Worked</label>
            <input type="date" id="last-day-worked" name="last-day-worked" aria-required="true">

            <label for="first-day-absent">First Day Absent</label>
            <input type="date" id="first-day-absent" name="first-day-absent" aria-required="true">

            <label for="nature-of-absence">Nature of Absence</label>
            <select id="nature-of-absence" name="nature-of-absence" aria-required="true">
                <option value="">Select...</option>
                <option value="illness">Illness</option>
                <option value="injury">Injury</option>
                <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>

            <label for="details">Details</label>
            <textarea id="details" name="details" rows="4" aria-required="true"></textarea>

            <label for="documents">Upload Documents</label>
            <input type="file" id="documents" name="documents" multiple aria-required="true">
            <div class="file-list" id="file-list"></div>

            <button type="submit">Submit Claim</button>
        </form>

        <div id="confirmation"></div>

        <div class="help-section">
            <p id="service-line-hours">Service Line Hours: </p>
            <a id="help-centre-link" href="#" target="_blank">Advisor Help Centre</a>
        </div>

        <footer>
            MapleSure Insurance — fictional demo application
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Mock data
        const mockMemberData = {
            "12345": "John Doe",
            "67890": "Jane Smith"
        };

        // Mock configuration
        const portalConfig = {
            serviceLineHours: "Mon-Fri 8am-8pm",
            helpCentreURL: "https://advisors.maplesure.com/help"
        };

        // Initialize configuration-dependent content
        document.getElementById('service-line-hours').textContent += portalConfig.serviceLineHours;
        document.getElementById('help-centre-link').setAttribute('href', portalConfig.helpCentreURL);

        // Form and user interaction
        document.getElementById('lookup-member').onclick = function() {
            const memberId = document.getElementById('member-id').value;
            const memberDetails = document.getElementById('member-details');
            memberDetails.textContent = mockMemberData[memberId] || 'Member not found';
        };

        document.getElementById('documents').onchange = function(event) {
            const fileList = document.getElementById('file-list');
            fileList.innerHTML = '';
            for (const file of event.target.files) {
                const listItem = document.createElement('div');
                listItem.textContent = file.name;
                fileList.appendChild(listItem);
            }
        };

        document.getElementById('claim-form').onsubmit = function(event) {
            event.preventDefault(); // Prevent actual form submission
            document.getElementById('claim-form').style.display = 'none';

            // Generate reference number
            const refNo = "MS-" + new Date().getFullYear() + "-08-" + Math.floor(Math.random() * 10000);

            const confirmationPanel = document.getElementById('confirmation');
            confirmationPanel.textContent = `Reference Number: ${refNo} \nStatus: Received`;
            confirmationPanel.style.display = 'block';
        };
    </script>
</body>
</html>


Acceptance criteria:
- US-5-AC1: Given someone viewing the support panel, when the hours or URL configuration changes, then the panel updates without redeploy.
- US-5-AC2: Given someone viewing the support panel, when checking accessibility, then the panel complies with WCAG 2.1 AA standards.

Write pytest tests (a single test_app.py) that verify the happy path
STRUCTURALLY against the actual file above — read index.html from
Path(__file__).parent and assert what the criteria need: the form and its
required field ids exist, the upload input allows multiple files, the
confirmation panel and status markup exist, the member lookup mock data is
present. 4 to 6 focused tests, stdlib + pytest only, no browser, no server,
no network. Every assertion must hold for the file exactly as shown above,
and must be independent of the current date, time, or environment — never
hard-code a year, month, or timestamp; where the page generates a value at
runtime, assert the generating code exists, not the value it would produce
today.

JSON schema: {"files": [{"path": "test_app.py", "content": str}]}
